hadiths[11]{hadithnumber,text}:
"376","Harami bin Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr bin Saeed se, unhon ne Hazrat Anas bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ghar walon par tamam logon se barh kar reham farmane wale thay, aur Aap ka ek doodh peeta beta Madina ke ek kinare mein doodh pilwaya jata tha, aur us ki daaya ka shohar lohar tha, aur hum Aap ke sath us ke pas jate thay, jabke ghar izkhir ki wajah se dhuwen se bhara hota tha, phir Aap use bosa dete thay aur sunghte thay."
"377","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Marwan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid bin Kaisan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Hazim se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke pas ek shakhs aya aur us ke sath ek bachcha tha, to woh use apne se lagane laga, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Kya tum is par reham karte ho, us ne kaha: Ji han, Aap ne farmaya: To Allah tum par tumhare is par reham karne se zyada reham farmane wala hai, aur Woh reham karne walon mein sab se barh kar reham farmane wala hai."
"378","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr ke aazad karda ghulam Sumayy se, Abu Salih Samman se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ek shakhs ek raste par chal raha tha ke use shadeed pyas lagi, to us ne ek kunwan paya to us mein utra, phir piya phir bahar nikla, to achanak ek kutta hanp raha tha, pyas ki wajah se geeli mitti kha raha tha, to us shakhs ne kaha: Yaqeenan is kutte ko pyas se waisi hi takleef pahunchi hai jaisi mujhe pahunchi thi, phir woh kunwen mein utra to apna moza pani se bhara, phir use apne munh se pakra, phir kutte ko pani pilaya, to Allah ne us ke is amal ki qadar farmai, phir use bakhsh diya, sahaba ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, kya waqai hamare liye chaupayon mein ajar hai, Aap ne farmaya: Har tar jigar rakhne wale jandar mein ajar hai."
"379","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, Nafi se, Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ek aurat ko ek billi ki wajah se azab diya gaya jisay us ne qaid kiya yahan tak ke woh bhook se mar gai, phir woh us ki wajah se aag mein dakhil hui, kaha jata hai, aur Allah zyada janne wala hai: Na tum ne use khilaya, aur na tum ne use pilaya jab tum ne use qaid kiya, aur na hi tum ne use chhora ke woh zameen ke keere makore kha leti."
"380","Muhammad bin Uqba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Usman Qureshi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hariz ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hibban bin Zaid Sharabi ne hum se bayan kiya, Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Reham karo tum par reham kiya jayega, aur bakhsho Allah tumhen bakhshega, baat ko sun kar mehfooz na rakhne walon ke liye halakat hai, aur israr karne walon ke liye halakat hai jo is par israr karte hain jo unhon ne kiya jabke woh jante hain."
"381","Mahmud ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Walid bin Jamil Kindi ne humen khabar di, Qasim bin Abdur Rahman se, Hazrat Abu Umama se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jo reham kare agarche zibah ki jane wali cheez par hi ho, Allah Qayamat ke din us par reham farmayega."
"382","Talq bin Ghannam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Masudi ne hum se bayan kiya, Hasan bin Saad se, Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah se, Hazrat Abdullah se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ek manzil par utre to ek shakhs ne surkh choti chidya ke ande le liye, to woh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sar par par phadphadati hui aai, to Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se kis ne isay is ke andon ki wajah se ghamzada kiya hai, to ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, main ne is ke ande liye hain, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Wapas kar do, is par reham karte hue."
"383","Aarim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Zubair Makkah mein thay aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahaba parindon ko pinjron mein liye hue thay."
"384","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mughira ne hum se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Hazrat Anas se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam andar tashreef laye to Abu Talha ke ek bete ko dekha jisay Abu Umair kaha jata tha, aur us ke pas ek choti chidya thi jis se woh khelta tha, to Aap ne farmaya: Ay Abu Umair, choti chidya ne kya kiya ya woh kahan hai."
"385","Abdullah bin Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Laith ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Humaid bin Abdur Rahman ne mujhe khabar di, ke un ki walida Umm Kulsum bint Uqba bin Abi Muait ne unhen khabar di, ke unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Woh jhoota nahin hai jo logon ke darmiyan sulah karaye, phir bhalai ki baat kahe ya bhalai ki baat pahunchaye, unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne Aap ko jhoot mein se kisi cheez mein rukhsat dete hue nahin suna jisay log kehte hain siwaye teen cheezon ke: Logon ke darmiyan sulah, aur mard ka apni biwi se baat karna, aur aurat ka apne shohar se baat karna."
"386","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Aamash se, Abu Wail se, Hazrat Abdullah se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Sach ko lazim pakro, pas beshak sach neki ki taraf rehnumai karta hai, aur beshak neki Jannat ki taraf rehnumai karti hai, aur beshak aadmi sach bolta rehta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke han siddiq likh diya jata hai, aur jhoot se bacho, pas beshak jhoot gunah ki taraf rehnumai karta hai, aur gunah aag ki taraf rehnumai karta hai, aur beshak aadmi jhoot bolta rehta hai yahan tak ke Allah ke han kazzab likh diya jata hai."
